Project modifications include X2 integration, gain recipes, locomotion
curricula and rewards, randomization, temporal observations, expert-policy
export, behavior evaluation and recording. The MJCF changes mesh paths,
adds foot sites, renames IMU sensors and adds a subtree angular-momentum
sensor. Mesh files are unchanged from the source revision above.

Product and organization names are used for identification and attribution.
